   "issues": [
     {"issue": "The object of the guarantee is missing from the executed text — \"it will guarantee all Saturday night Bulldog [gap] uding routes and relays)\" — so what is guaranteed (routes, jobs, a number) cannot be read off the words. The condition \"so long as it has a Saturday night Bulldog Edition\" also leaves the guarantee terminable at The Times' election to drop the edition.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.42}
